---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { profile } from '../../data/profile';
---
<BaseLayout title={`Privacy Notice — ${profile.name}`} description={`Learn how the personal portfolio of ${profile.name} handles contact messages, external project previews and basic website usage data.`}>
  <article class="privacy container" aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
    <p class="section-kicker">INFORMATION / PRIVACY</p>
    <h1 id="privacy-title">PRIVACY<span>.</span></h1>
    <p class="privacy-lead">A clear explanation of how information is handled when you browse this portfolio or get in touch.</p>
    <p class="privacy-updated">Last updated: 23 October 2026</p>
    <div class="privacy-content">
      <section><h2>Who operates this website?</h2><p>This personal portfolio belongs to <strong>{profile.name}</strong>, a software engineer based in Karachi, Pakistan. For privacy questions, write to <a href={`mailto:${profile.links.email}`}>{profile.links.email}</a>.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Information you choose to share</h2><p>This portfolio does not currently contain a contact-submission form or visitor account system. If you contact me by email, WhatsApp, LinkedIn or another linked service, I receive the information you decide to provide. I use correspondence to respond to enquiries and discuss potential projects and collaborations.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Analytics, cookies and website logs</h2><p>This website is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. The portfolio source does not intentionally add advertising pixels or third-party analytics scripts. Cloudflare may process technical request information such as IP addresses, browser information, timestamps and security logs to deliver and protect the website. If analytics or other tracking tools are introduced, this notice will be updated.</p></section>
      <section><h2>External websites and project images</h2><p>Project case studies may request screenshots from public GitHub-hosted image URLs. Those requests may expose basic connection information to the image host. Links to repositories, live projects and social profiles open services with their own privacy practices. Please review their policies when using them.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Retention and your choices</h2><p>Messages may be retained for as long as reasonably needed to respond to enquiries or maintain a professional record, subject to applicable requirements. To ask about, correct or request deletion of information you sent directly, contact me at <a href={`mailto:${profile.links.email}`}>{profile.links.email}</a>. Third-party platforms handle information under their own policies.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Changes to this notice</h2><p>This notice may be updated when hosting, functionality or data-handling practices change. The revision date at the top will be updated accordingly.</p></section>
    </div>
    <a href="/contact/" class="privacy-contact">CONTACT ME <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.privacy{padding-top:clamp(132px,12vw,185px);padding-bottom:120px;max-width:1110px}
.privacy h1{font:900 clamp(65px,12vw,142px)/1 Impact,'Arial Narrow',sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:25px 0 20px}
.privacy h1 span{color:var(--red)}
.privacy-lead{max-width:690px;color:#e4d6d9;font-size:clamp(17px,2vw,23px);line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 12px}
.privacy-updated{color:#bcaab1;font-size:12px;margin:0 0 57px}
.privacy-content{max-width:770px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.19)}
.privacy-content section{padding:25px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13)}
.privacy-content h2{font:800 clamp(23px,3.5vw,34px)/1.2 Arial,sans-serif;margin:0 0 16px}
.privacy-content p{color:#cbbcc0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;margin:0}
.privacy-content a{color:#fff;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:var(--red);text-underline-offset:4px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.privacy-contact{display:inline-flex;gap:34px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:2px solid var(--red);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.15em;font-weight:900;margin-top:50px;padding:12px 0}
.privacy-contact span{color:var(--red)}
@media(max-width:640px){.privacy{padding-bottom:70px}.privacy-content p{font-size:14px}}
</style>
